  "dijkstra 8 ugraph ⟦1, 8, 9⟧ ⟦⟨8, 9, Fraction⟨3, 1⟩⟩, ⟨9, 8, Fraction⟨3, 1⟩⟩, ⟨1, 9, Fraction⟨8, 1⟩⟩⟧",
